// Update updates the title, body, state, assignees, labels, milestone, type, or field values of an issue. Supply only the properties you want to change; `state_reason` applies only when you change `state`, and `duplicate_issue_id` applies only when `state_reason` is `duplicate`. Users with push access or the Triage role can edit issues, but milestone, label, type, and field-value changes require push access.
